with gpgkey-6D5B_EF9A_DD20_7580_5747_B70F_9F88_FB52_FAF7_B393.asc, the
key upstream publishes at
https://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/6D5BEF9ADD2075805747B70F9F88FB52FAF7B393#/gpgkey-6D5B_EF9A_DD20_7580_5747_B70F_9F88_FB52_FAF7_B393.asc
(byte for byte); its Source line is now that URL.

The current key is needed to verify the release signature with
openpgpverify (sqv), which checks that the key was valid when the
release was signed.

